feat: three-theme system (Coinbase Blue default) + correct 5-15 day payout

Theme system: all ~70 colour values moved onto CSS custom properties keyed by
html[data-theme]. Three themes - blue (default), dark, light - with an accessible
switcher in the topbar. Text colour differs between the page canvas and the cards
sitting on it, so ink/body/muted/link each have a canvas-* and surface-* flavour.

Also corrects the payout timing: eligible rewards are paid within 5-15 days of the
qualifying purchase (per Coinbase's promotion documentation), replacing the
previous 45-day figure drawn from the referral page.
